  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think it would be nice if it was possible to write and attach custom notes to the description of VRC groups, similarly to how you can already add \"notes\" to users' profiles which is useful if you want to remark something about the person. \n\nFor example, I have many groups of Japanese musical venues but I struggle to recall all the details about each venue and my Japanese isn't in a good enough shape to understand a group's posts or description. So, it would be easier if there was a possibility to put some short note about a group to remind yourself what's this group is for. For example: \"a club managed by UserName\", \"that old-time venue from October\", \"an information group of the owner of ClubName\", etc. \n\nThis would be much easier than having to open the VRC website on desktop and copypaste the description of the group to translate it every time you forget something.",
